flowchart LR
    subgraph Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
        App[App registration]
        SP[Enterprise application<br/>service principal]
        Grant[Broad Graph application grant<br/>Mail.Read or Mail.Send]
        Token[App-only token]
        App --> SP
        SP --> Grant
        SP --> Token
        Grant --> Token
    end

    subgraph Exchange[Exchange Online]
        Graph[Graph mailbox request]
        AAP[Legacy RestrictAccess<br/>Application Access Policy]
        Group[Mail-enabled security group]
        Allowed[Allowed mailbox<br/>direct group member]
        Denied[Other mailbox<br/>not a group member]
        Graph --> AAP
        Group --> AAP
        AAP -->|Granted| Allowed
        AAP -.->|Denied| Denied
    end

    Token --> Graph